{
"file": 1053,
"paths": [
"d008/d148/f020"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "2a977bb6",
"en_raw": "Looks like someone's here"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "d606b137",
"en_raw": "It's covered in dust"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "f1f786c6",
"en_raw": "...What's fun"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "c2830c39",
"en_raw": "about pachinko"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "fdb9b290",
"en_raw": "It's a grand reopening..."
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "4c832065",
"en_raw": "An upfront investment is necessary..."
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "63f44487",
"en_raw": "Looks like an all-nighter today..."
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "2c30c3d5",
"en_raw": "Not a ghost after all"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "2d023aa9",
"en_raw": "Excuse me"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "e73c7b09",
"en_raw": "Sorry to bother you"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "e2e2a234",
"en_raw": "when you're busy"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "76427ddd",
"en_raw": "Are you the manager here?"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "d4f81069",
"en_raw": "Ah, a kid..."
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "a4f3711a",
"en_raw": "Where did you slip in from?"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "83630668",
"en_raw": "Um, excuse me"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "0a072707",
"en_raw": "I was trying to"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "4a52b30b",
"en_raw": "borrow the toilet"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "779cd054",
"en_raw": "Sure, use it as you like..."
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "3e82c27e",
"en_raw": "But... it appears"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "6c4d5c64",
"en_raw": "Listen, you can hear it, right?"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "3479fa1b",
"en_raw": "That woman's voice"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "a2bf04aa",
"en_raw": "What are you talking about?"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "92b8869f",
"en_raw": "Listen / Don't  ......"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "01290b77",
"en_raw": "It's just a broken ventilation fan"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "b558cad7",
"en_raw": "That's not it"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "564e7c35",
"en_raw": "That's a woman's voice"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "89dea10f",
"en_raw": "who came out resenting me"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "76f554ae",
"en_raw": "Listen again carefully"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "e470b0e6",
"en_raw": "I don't hear such a sound at all"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "dc2c8c3d",
"en_raw": "Listen very carefully"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "0fb4ff01",
"en_raw": "...I can't hear it"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "f45be546",
"en_raw": "...She said she'd die"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "a593d664",
"en_raw": "I thought it was her usual hysterics"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "67e51fe5",
"en_raw": "I was fed up"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "983d422c",
"en_raw": "I told her to go ahead and die"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "c1ee7496",
"en_raw": "left her and walked out of the hall"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "ce05de2c",
"en_raw": "...Then the next morning I came"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "5a54e230",
"en_raw": "and she was dangling from the ceiling"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "969c9179",
"en_raw": "That woman, honestly"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "053cf03b",
"en_raw": "dirtying my shop"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "f02df753",
"en_raw": "Dangling from the ceiling, what's that about?"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "4c1fd024",
"en_raw": "...Now, I'm working"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "9cd4eb49",
"en_raw": "leave when you're done"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "fdb9b290",
"en_raw": "It's a grand reopening..."
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "4c832065",
"en_raw": "An upfront investment is necessary..."
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "63f44487",
"en_raw": "Looks like an all-nighter today..."
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "02df979b",
"en_raw": "Sorry"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "6b95412f",
"en_raw": "Oh, that kid from before..."
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "a186e235",
"en_raw": "Don't use my shop as a playground"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "2a1a6864",
"en_raw": "Shop? There are no customers"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "a46b9cb2",
"en_raw": "and it's not even open"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "34fc80e1",
"en_raw": "I'll open it from now"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "4826303d",
"en_raw": "Just watch"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "1e5578a3",
"en_raw": "I'll pack it full"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "1fcddee2",
"en_raw": "Come to think of it, that story"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "4cfdf557",
"en_raw": "about dangling from the ceiling..."
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "f925dd8a",
"en_raw": "It's almost time"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "fe388a35",
"en_raw": "...About what?"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "d123bca7",
"en_raw": "That woman is coming"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "fcd4844c",
"en_raw": "Hey, that means..."
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "1e2ab92f",
"en_raw": "Here she comes..."
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "c08bd516",
"en_raw": "Whatever she says"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "8ba322b9",
"en_raw": "in the end she begs for money"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "67eea098",
"en_raw": "Such a nasty woman"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "26a78020",
"en_raw": "...What are you saying?"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "933a3045",
"en_raw": "Can't you see?"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "2c7686af",
"en_raw": "Look, she's standing behind you"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "c6da3ce6",
"en_raw": "Then I'll be going..."
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "fefac4e0",
"en_raw": "Now, wait"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "3e2fc865",
"en_raw": "Th-there's nobody there"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "199a7dd3",
"en_raw": "...There is"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "ddcd8f26",
"en_raw": "Kids can't see her"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "0bb5e090",
"en_raw": "After all, I'm the one"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "d371f608",
"en_raw": "who killed her"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "e3ea9f93",
"en_raw": "and swung a kitchen knife"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "d369a916",
"en_raw": "I took it and stabbed her"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "96f9f138",
"en_raw": "Self-defense, of course"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "05b7f697",
"en_raw": "...Then what was that earlier"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "06eaa569",
"en_raw": "about dangling from the ceiling?"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "2ad97335",
"en_raw": "Ah, that woman..."
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "5fe30eb6",
"en_raw": "Well, leave it alone"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "1629f4de",
"en_raw": "women don't matter"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "4c0b4dd9",
"en_raw": "Anyway, right now..."
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "fdb9b290",
"en_raw": "It's a grand reopening..."
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "4c832065",
"en_raw": "An upfront investment is necessary..."
},
{
"n": 85,
